&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this role is&amp;nbsp;CHF 140,000 - CHF 155,000. There are&amp;nbsp;a number of&amp;nbsp;factors which affect what the specific pay for this role is,&amp;nbsp;including seniority and relevant educational and working experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We enjoy an ‘office-first’ culture and maximize opportunities to collaborate,&amp;nbsp;connect&amp;nbsp;and learn together. Our hybrid working models differ depending on your role and location. Occasional travel may be&amp;nbsp;required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
